		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Multi-tusked, magical boar that quakes the earth when charging. Violent, territorial.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tusk +8 (2d8), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Gore</strong>. Deals an extra die of damage if it hits the same target with both tusks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Quaking Charge</strong>. When charging, a far-sized area around the ypotryll cracks and is difficult to move in.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
